WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.185 --> 00:00:02.695
What stays on. A synthetic field-power rehearsal.

2
00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:05.273
Minute 00. Four loads supplied. The generator charges the battery.

3
00:00:05.314 --> 00:00:08.122
Minute 04. The generator trips. Demand exceeds the battery output limit.

4
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:11.407
Minute 13. Two loads shed. Restart approval waits on an interrupted link.

5
00:00:11.954 --> 00:00:14.956
Minute 34. Stored energy has fallen. The battery percentage is still held.

6
00:00:14.972 --> 00:00:18.178
The late approval has expired. No restart was applied.

7
00:00:18.204 --> 00:00:21.411
Minute 36. A fresh proposal and approval. Warm-up begins; the old receipt remains.

8
00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:24.653
Minute 42. The generator reaches capacity. Supply has returned.

9
00:00:24.671 --> 00:00:27.681
Open the energy balance. Keep the no-action account alongside it.
